OL,6,     FThe final part of the documentary
OL,7,     Fseries brings the participants
OL,8,     Ftogether for one last reckoning
OL,9,     Fwith their extraordinary lives -
OL,10,     Fand with the series that has
OL,11,     Ffollowed them since childhood.
OL,12,     FSue, Bruce, Jackie, Suzy, Peter,
OL,13,     FJohn and Andrew each revisit the
OL,14,     Fhopes and expectations captured on
OL,15,     Ffilm throughout their lives, with
OL,16,     Ftheir stories having become a
OL,17,     Fcollective portrait of Britain
OL,18,     Facross seven decades, and of the
OL,19,     Fforces of class, education, wealth
OL,20,     Fand opportunity that have shaped
OL,21,     Fthem
